            "title": "Bingo Downtime May 31st, 2022",
            "date": "2022-05-31 12:33:30",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4437747060845217997",
            "content": "[h2]Bingo on Stream will be down this evening (Tuesday May 31st, 2022) from approx. 9-930 pm EST for some server maintenance/upgrades.\n\nThanks you![/h2]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Version 0.0.7 Patch Notes",
            "date": "2022-05-20 17:26:21",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4292505348830219900",
            "content": "- Added the ability to cancel a Twitch login. This will allow players to cancel and retry their login if something goes wrong during that process.\n- Upon changing the Effects or Announcer volume, a sound will now be played to preview the new volume.\n- Announcer clips will now only play one at a time. If a clip is playing, it will stop in favour of playing the most recent Announcement. This should fix the Announcer talking over himself in certain situations.\n- Added sorting to the Ban List in the Options Menu. Date Banned is the default sort.\n- Fixed improper sprite sizing in the Controls panel of the Options Menu. Control Binding buttons should now look higher resolution."
        },
